'''Queensfields''' is an [[Locations|area]] located in [[Sanctuary]] where [[Bixies|bixies]] work at, it is full of [[Bixie Soldier|bixie soldiers]], [[Bixie Battlemage|bixie mages]], and worker bixies. The [[Bixie Hive]] is located in Queensfield, it also where the [[Harvesting]] [[Mini-Games|minigame]] is located. The area is seen as several giant bee nests. NPC Bixies fly above the player.

